    "text_full": "Help Center\nLogin\nProduct\nSolutions\nResources\nAPI\nPlans & Pricing\nTry for Free\nRequest a Demo\nGet paid faster with Blueink Payments\nCollect payments and signatures in one step. Blueink Payments combines document signing with instant payment collection, helping you close deals and get paid in one streamlined workflow.\nSimplify transactions with payment-enabled eSignatures\nManage transactions more efficiently, save time, and elevate the signing experience for both parties. Blueink Payments streamlines your workflow, helping you close deals faster by eliminating the need for separate payment steps.\nGet paid instantly, no follow-ups needed\n\nBlueink Payments removes the hassle of chasing payments by allowing you to collect payments instantly as documents are signed. With payments integrated into your document signing workflow, this feature closes the gap between agreement and payment processing, ensuring faster cash flow and reducing the need for follow-ups\n\nSecure payments powered by Stripe\n\nPowered by Stripe, a global leader in electronic payments, you can rest easy knowing that every transaction is protected with bank-grade security. With world-class security infrastructure trusted by millions of businesses worldwide, Stripe provides peace of mind for both you and your signers.\n\nSeamless experience for everyone\n\nBlueink Payments connects signing and payment, eliminating the need for platform switching. This intuitive experience saves valuable time and effort, creating a smoother transaction for both senders and signers.\n\nEasy and convenient set up and tracking\n\nSetting up Blueink Payments is a breeze—simply connect your Stripe account and start collecting payments with any envelope you send. Enjoy the convenience of monitoring both signature status and payment collection in a centralized dashboard. With real-time updates and clear indicators, you’ll always know where things stand at a glance.\n\nTestimonials\nEducation\nAngelina B.\nSPED Coordinator\nLifesaver for Schools\nBlueink is very user-friendly. It is such a huge timesaver and allows our district to meet virtually and send and receive documents in real time. Users can also see when people have signed the documents, and who needs to sign with a reminder feature to resend the documents. I have no complaints about Blueink! All users are able to access the documents, sign them electronically, and receive a copy in a timely manner.\nEducation\nBette Jo T.\nAdministrative Assistant\nCustomer service is superior to Docusign\nUtilizing BlueInk has improved our department greatly! We are able to get necessary paperwork signed quickly and I love how BlueInk sends reminders when the forms are not signed. We can [also] send consent forms via BlueInk and get it signed that very same day. When using USPS, we might wait for months for the paperwork.\nEducation\nElizabeth B.\nDirector of Special Education\nExcellent product to obtain quick and easy signature\nI absolutely love this product and use it daily.\nEducation\nJason V.\nDirector of Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Programs\nBLUEINK is the best solution that I have found for Digital Signatures in an Educational environment\nExceptional! I have told all of my colleagues about this program and am excited to present on it in the future; as it is a truly perfect fit for Work-Based Learning and Youth Apprenticeship Coordinators in Georgia!\nEducation\nJulie H.\nRecruiting\nVery impactful – bundling documents saves us money\nThe business problem we have solved is sending documents in a bundle. With our last company, we had to send individual documents, which was much more costly. Our experience [with Blueink] has been great.\nEducation\nJulie L\nHR Manager\nGrateful for this Product\nI especially like that I can obtain an electronic signature due to folks being at different locations. I also appreciate the tracking abilities. It is simply a quality product!!\nPick your plan\nBilled monthly\nBilled yearly\n\n*Save up to 40%\nStandard\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nStandard plan - 40% less\n\n$15\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$180 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nStandard Plan includes:\n120 Envelopes / User / Year\n5 Templates / User\nBlueink Payments\nAuto Detect Fields\nReal-time audit trail\nSMS Pin / Selfie / ID Authentication\nCC Additional Recipients\nEmail / Chat Support\nBusiness Pro\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nBusiness Pro plan - 25% less\n\n$30\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$360 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Standard features, plus:\n1800 Envelopes / User / Year\n12 Templates / User\nSMS Delivery\nReminder Emails\nCustom Messaging\nAttachment Fields\nMOST POPULAR\nBlueink Unlimited\n\nSimilar to DocuSign\nProfessional Unlimited - 86% less\n\n$40\nPER USER / PER MONTH\n\n$480 billed annually\n\nBuy Now\nAll Business Pro features, plus:\nUnlimited Envelopes / User / Year\nUnlimited Templates\nTeams\nSigning Brands\nEnterprise\n\nAdvanced Solutions\n\n\n\nLet’s talk\nUNLIMITED USERS\nContact Sales\nOther benefits include:\n\nUnlimited Users\nUnlimited Templates\nBulk Send\nSmart Link Forms\nCustom Reporting\nCustomer Success Team\nAPI and Embedded Signing Access\n\nLooking for quote? Request a personalized quote from Blueink.\n\nAdvanced functionality at the best price\nFeature  name\nBlueink\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nCompetitor\nPrice\n$15 / Per User\n$25 / Per User\n$14.99 / Per User\n$19 / Per User\nUsers\nUnlimited\nCost Per\nCost Per\nCost Per\nNo Overages Fees\nUnused Envelopes\nRollover\nExpire\nExpire\nExpire\nSupport, Training & Onboarding\nIncluded\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nAdditional Cost\nUnlimited Envelope Plan\nCustomer Service\n4.8/5\n4.3/5\n4.5/5\n4.3/5\nFAQs\nWhat is Blueink Payments?\n\nBlueink Payments is a seamless way to collect payments alongside document signatures. Powered by Stripe, it allows you to securely request and process payments directly within your eSignature workflow.\n\nWhat payment methods does Blueink accept?\n\